   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFQ & booking agent\n1. extract: origin, dest, kg, cbm,\n   pieces, pickup?, cheapest/fastest\n2. fan out: rate sheets + portal API\n   + bid mails to 2–5 carriers\n3. pick winner via pricing module\n4. reply in thread: 1 all-in total + ccy\n5. on accept → book by rate ID",
   "originalText": "RFQ & booking agent\n1. extract: origin, dest, kg, cbm,\n   pieces, pickup?, cheapest/fastest\n2. fan out: rate sheets + portal API\n   + bid mails to 2–5 carriers\n3. pick winner via pricing module\n4. reply in thread: 1 all-in total + ccy\n5. on accept → book by rate ID",
